# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the mock test jobs (test:api:tsan).
# Each entry is a known non-libnvmpi report; keep this list short and justified.

# NVMPI_bufPool waits with condition_variable::wait_for, which libstdc++ on
# jammy (GCC 11) maps to pthread_cond_clockwait. GCC 11's libtsan does not
# intercept that call, so it misses the mutex release inside the wait and
# reports "double lock" on every later lock from another thread. Toolchain
# false positive (GCC PR 101978, fixed in GCC 12's libtsan).
mutex:NVMPI_bufPool

# NvV4l2ElementPlane (NVIDIA sample class, vendored copy): the DQ thread
# polls the plain-bool streamon/is_in_error flags that the owner writes under
# the plane lock. Pre-existing upstream pattern; benign on aarch64 (aligned
# byte, loop re-reads). Not a libnvmpi defect.
race:NvV4l2ElementPlane::dqThread
race:NvV4l2ElementPlane::isInError
